      "solution": {
        "lines": [
          "$1 = \\dfrac{20}{20}$ .",
          "$\\dfrac{2}{5} = \\dfrac{2 \\times 4}{5 \\times 4} = \\dfrac{8}{20}$ .",
          "ما أُخذ : $\\dfrac{2}{5} + \\dfrac{3}{20} = \\dfrac{8 + 3}{20} = \\dfrac{11}{20}$ .",
          "الباقي : $1 - \\dfrac{11}{20} = \\dfrac{20}{20} - \\dfrac{11}{20} = \\dfrac{9}{20}$ ."
        ],
